WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.912
Ninety three million dollars for a COVID questionnaire.

00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:07.350
Original estimate: eighty thousand dollars.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.650
Two-person contractor.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.712
Zero code written.

00:00:11.712 --> 00:00:15.650
Seventy-six percent of subcontractors did no work.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.425
Every Liberal MP voted against recovering the money.
